{% iconblock source="From usability testing sessions and surveys with country offices, using a design prototype" %}
8 participants {% mark text="successfully found and used" color="green" /%} the Explore mode to show alerts from a specific geographic location in 33 seconds on average, and gave an average ease score of 8.6 out of 10.
{% /iconblock %}
